     A*  04/10/91 KWK  PROJECT AHE                                    *
     A*                CHANGED BILLING SCHEDULE PERCENTAGES FROM A32  *
     A*                TO A98 TO ALLOW THE USER TO SPECIFY            *
     A*                PERCENTAGES UP TO SIX DECIMAL PLACES (EX.      *
     A*                33.333333 %).  ALSO, ADDED ROLLOVER CODE THAT  *
     A*                WILL DETERMINE ON ROLLOVER WHAT THE BILLING    *
     A*                SCHEDULE CODE WILL BE FOR THE NEW FUND YEAR.   *
     A*                                                               *
